WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.980
Hello, I am Girish.

00:00:03.340 --> 00:00:09.980
I am a backend enterprise
architect who has experience

00:00:10.020 --> 00:00:17.100
building software systems and
designing solutions for enterprises.

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:26.668
I have been working with industry
for more than 12 years now and

00:00:26.708 --> 00:00:31.980
I have worked with a university as well.

00:00:33.540 --> 00:00:42.060
I have relevant experience
in developing software

00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:49.160
for enterprises which use
communication systems.

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:52.880
In my prior experience,

00:00:53.520 --> 00:01:04.700
I have worked with Cisco
for WebEx Teams software.

00:01:04.740 --> 00:01:13.940
I have developed backend
microservices for Cisco.

00:01:14.480 --> 00:01:17.500
Apart from that

00:01:17.540 --> 00:01:27.622
I have worked extensively
using service-oriented

00:01:27.662 --> 00:01:38.020
architecture and built
software as a Service, SaaS.

00:01:40.060 --> 00:01:47.040
My recent project was
with OpenProject GmbH,

00:01:47.600 --> 00:01:54.360
a project management software
company based in Berlin, Germany.

00:01:54.860 --> 00:01:58.120
I have built integrations to support

00:01:58.160 --> 00:02:07.060
OpenProject with communication
platforms such as

00:02:07.100 --> 00:02:11.480
Matrix, also known as Element.

00:02:11.520 --> 00:02:14.140
I have also developed
integrations for Mattermost

00:02:16.180 --> 00:02:19.180
and I have white-labelled

00:02:19.220 --> 00:02:25.660
OpenProject and customized
it to allow portfolio

00:02:25.700 --> 00:02:38.000
management features which
are free and open source.

00:02:38.040 --> 00:02:45.820
These days portfolio
management offered by companies

00:02:45.860 --> 00:02:51.160
are proprietary by nature.

00:02:51.200 --> 00:03:00.240
Some of the few examples include
Jira Align and IBM Apptio.

00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:07.360
To provide a free and open
source alternative I have built

00:03:07.400 --> 00:03:13.140
Yojana which is the
portfolio management software

00:03:13.180 --> 00:03:16.080
along with project management.

00:03:16.120 --> 00:03:21.240
It is GPL-licensed software

00:03:21.280 --> 00:03:30.740
and compatible with open
source copyleft licenses.

00:03:32.020 --> 00:03:34.460
There is no vendor lock-in

00:03:34.500 --> 00:03:41.580
or any constraints for the
enterprise, small teams,

00:03:42.180 --> 00:03:46.760
users who are using Yojana.

00:03:49.280 --> 00:03:53.526
I have also worked on building

00:03:53.566 --> 00:04:00.555
AI enabled chat features
integrated with Yojana

00:04:00.595 --> 00:04:06.384
and it enables the user
to use an LLM model

00:04:06.424 --> 00:04:14.441
which is locally hosted and
access the features offered

00:04:14.481 --> 00:04:21.299
by the portfolio management
software as well as

00:04:21.339 --> 00:04:26.099
project management seamlessly.

00:04:26.139 --> 00:04:32.442
One of the important
focus areas of building

00:04:32.482 --> 00:04:41.740
Yojana has been data privacy,
data sovereignty and open source.

00:04:43.680 --> 00:04:54.500
So this software allows
the users to modify,

00:04:54.980 --> 00:05:04.960
change certain features and
distribute those changes as well.

00:05:05.580 --> 00:05:12.928
It provides all those
freedoms unlike a proprietary

00:05:12.968 --> 00:05:18.805
software which are licensed by companies

00:05:18.845 --> 00:05:23.338
and hold copyrights and patents

00:05:23.378 --> 00:05:30.055
which disallow users to
make changes, improve,

00:05:30.095 --> 00:05:35.300
test, debug and share those changes.

00:05:36.620 --> 00:05:43.995
Yojana offers a free-as-in-freedom project

00:05:44.035 --> 00:05:51.996
management and portfolio
management solution.

00:05:52.036 --> 00:06:00.192
And our target audience
will be small enterprises

00:06:00.232 --> 00:06:04.486
who are building products

00:06:04.526 --> 00:06:14.438
and need these tools to be able
to manage their work packages,

00:06:14.478 --> 00:06:19.902
schedule meetings, track costs,

00:06:19.942 --> 00:06:25.951
implement workflows and also be able

00:06:25.991 --> 00:06:37.700
to communicate with other enterprise
software using a common webhook.

00:06:41.760 --> 00:06:47.038
So Yojana is currently under development

00:06:47.078 --> 00:06:52.700
and its build has been
deployed for testing.

00:06:54.490 --> 00:06:58.622
There are still a lot of features

00:06:58.662 --> 00:07:05.576
that need to be tested
thoroughly before rolling out.

00:07:05.616 --> 00:07:10.057
The repository is hosted on GitHub

00:07:10.097 --> 00:07:14.847
and there have been constant changes

00:07:14.887 --> 00:07:19.483
and bug fixes being committed to it.

00:07:19.523 --> 00:07:27.518
I am the author of Yojana and I
am the solo contributor as of now.

00:07:27.558 --> 00:07:30.608
I guess that wraps up all

00:07:30.648 --> 00:07:39.579
I have to say about my project
and my previous experiences. Also

00:07:39.619 --> 00:07:50.368
I host a portfolio website called
girishm.info where all the projects,

00:07:50.408 --> 00:07:58.140
past and current, and the
experience is mentioned.

00:08:01.230 --> 00:08:02.420
Thank you for your time.
